    "_note_validation": "Verified against the validation path itself. A left+right bare-modifier pair is VALID on macOS (the `bare` check short-circuits validation to null). The CommandOrControl spelling that Klaus's existing defaults use is accepted only because validateGlobalAccelerator adds it to the primary-modifier set; a stricter check that omits it would reject CommandOrControl+Shift+K as 'exactly one non-modifier key'.",
    "bareModifiers": [
